SUMMARY:I Play Rocky
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:30pm\, 3:30pm\, 6:15pm\nI PLAY ROCKY is an electrifyi
 ng true story about an unknown actor with an unshakable belief that he was
 n't just meant to write Rocky--he was meant to be Rocky Balboa. Told "no" 
 at every turn\, Sylvester Stallone bets everything on himself\, holding th
 e line on playing the lead against seemingly impossible odds. The result i
 s the ultimate underdog story behind the ultimate underdog movie.\nhttps:/
 /www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/i-play-rocky\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https:/
 /pushpin.city/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/i-play-rocky
